# Copy to .env. Both values are safe to hold locally and are NOT secrets:
# the anon key is published by Supabase for client use and grants nothing on
# its own. Every analytics read is gated behind an admin check in the
# database, so a stolen anon key still cannot read a single event.
#
# Never put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here or anywhere in this folder.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY
